HWE (Hardware Enablement) packages in Forsaken Linux provide newer Linux kernels,packages,and graphics stacks for any Forsaken Linux releases to support new hardware
Introduced in September 13 2026 With Trixie Backports

To install HWE

Run sudo nano /etc/apt/sources.list
Change all main non-free-firmware to main contrib non-free non-free-firmware including the Trixie Backports

Then add at the end # Forsaken Linux HWE
after Forsaken Linux HWE add
deb https://deb.debian.org/debian trixie-backports main contrib non-free non-free-firmware
deb-src https://deb.debian.org/debian trixie-backports main contrib non-free non-free-firmware

After this ctrl x y enter then run sudo apt update then run sudo apt full-upgrade -y -t trixie-backports && sudo apt autoremove -y

Latest Release is Forsaken Linux HWE 1 Based on Trixie Backports

NOTE: Forsaken Linux HWE Is Supported on Forsaken Linux 2 (stalemate) and higher it is not supported on Forsaken Linux 1 (eclipse)
